WEBVTT

01:40.050 --> 01:42.979
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.130 --> 01:45.900
[Episode 21]

01:55.860 --> 01:57.050
Situ Ming,

01:57.670 --> 01:59.250
you hid a criminal.

01:59.780 --> 02:01.130
Do you admit your crime?

02:16.430 --> 02:18.230
I wanted to catch Zhao Yuanzhou,

02:18.290 --> 02:20.220
but I found something unexpected.

02:25.550 --> 02:26.800
Zhao Yuanzhou,

02:26.870 --> 02:27.870
no matter where you hide,

02:27.870 --> 02:29.310
it's all in vain.

02:30.579 --> 02:32.550
You underestimate the demon energy tracking spell

02:32.550 --> 02:34.150
of the Chongwu Camp.

02:37.110 --> 02:38.120
Indeed.

02:38.460 --> 02:39.800
You are truly dogs.

02:43.950 --> 02:45.310
Still throwing insults

02:45.600 --> 02:47.220
when you're facing death?

02:52.950 --> 02:54.400
Useless.

02:57.120 --> 02:57.710
Stop, Master!

02:57.710 --> 02:58.390
Jiu!

02:59.360 --> 03:01.550
I won't allow you to hurt my friends.

03:15.970 --> 03:16.920
Bai Jiu,

03:17.550 --> 03:19.550
since you still call me Master,

03:20.970 --> 03:22.990
shouldn't you repay me

03:22.990 --> 03:25.470
and take Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core now?

03:26.850 --> 03:28.180
Repay you?

03:28.200 --> 03:30.480
Why don't we repay you with a beating?

03:32.820 --> 03:34.970
Who helped you when you were the most

03:34.990 --> 03:36.320
confused and helpless?

03:37.030 --> 03:38.430
Who took you in

03:38.450 --> 03:39.850
and taught you medicine?

03:40.360 --> 03:42.900
Will you repay my kindness with hatred?

03:44.630 --> 03:45.270
Jiu,

03:45.600 --> 03:46.530
don't trust him.

03:46.829 --> 03:48.290
He taught you those skills

03:48.790 --> 03:50.750
just to use you to harm people.

03:51.750 --> 03:52.550
That's right.

03:53.980 --> 03:55.170
I must

03:55.510 --> 03:58.840
take responsibility for and fix some mistakes personally.

03:59.930 --> 04:01.610
I won't respect you anymore.

04:03.180 --> 04:04.130
Previously,

04:04.270 --> 04:05.070
I hurt

04:05.150 --> 04:06.830
and lied to my friends.

04:07.190 --> 04:09.400
I will do my best to make up for it.

04:14.020 --> 04:14.980
Sister Pei.

04:15.430 --> 04:16.490
Give me the arrow.

04:18.269 --> 04:19.440
What are you doing?

04:42.550 --> 04:43.110
Jiu.

04:43.140 --> 04:43.920
Jiu.

04:44.270 --> 04:46.000
Don't hurt yourself like this.

04:50.790 --> 04:53.720
Isn't Little Bunny the most timid and afraid of pain?

04:55.230 --> 04:56.470
I am timid

04:58.030 --> 04:59.090
and afraid of pain,

05:01.280 --> 05:03.340
but I'm more afraid of losing you all.

05:13.630 --> 05:14.710
From now on,

05:15.350 --> 05:17.480
I'm no longer a member of Chongwu Camp.

05:17.550 --> 05:19.310
I won't let you manipulate me

05:19.310 --> 05:20.190
as your puppet anymore.

05:20.190 --> 05:20.990
Enough.

05:23.230 --> 05:24.880
Since this is your decision,

05:27.210 --> 05:29.060
don't blame me for being cruel.

05:51.630 --> 05:52.580
Shoot!

06:37.060 --> 06:37.920
They can't be killed.

06:37.920 --> 06:39.320
Demonized humans again?

06:39.630 --> 06:40.830
Zhao Yuanzhou.

06:41.320 --> 06:42.240
Do something.

06:53.320 --> 06:54.740
Stop.

07:01.280 --> 07:02.480
Your magic

07:02.770 --> 07:05.830
is useless against these demonized humans and arrows.

07:07.110 --> 07:10.170
My Demon Slaying Arrow specializes in killing demons.

07:10.700 --> 07:12.640
How can you control it?

07:15.430 --> 07:16.490
Zhao Yuanzhou,

07:17.680 --> 07:19.640
don't waste your energy in resisting.

07:19.640 --> 07:21.090
Surrender.

08:11.820 --> 08:12.500
Oh no.

08:12.760 --> 08:14.280
There's a silver needle on the arrow.

08:14.280 --> 08:16.210
He sealed the Great Demon's touch.

08:17.400 --> 08:18.870
Zhao Yuanzhou.

08:19.110 --> 08:21.150
Now, there's only one last step left

08:21.150 --> 08:22.550
to seal your five senses.

08:23.170 --> 08:24.750
I just need to use the silver needle

08:24.750 --> 08:26.300
to seal your sense of touch

08:26.750 --> 08:28.750
and everything will be set.

08:29.040 --> 08:30.010
Master,

08:30.510 --> 08:32.270
why will sealing a demon's five senses

08:32.270 --> 08:34.270
make them spit out their inner core?

08:34.470 --> 08:36.070
With the five senses sealed,

08:36.110 --> 08:37.309
the physical body will become

08:37.309 --> 08:38.830
a tight jar.

08:39.190 --> 08:41.120
The inner core has a conscious mind

08:41.710 --> 08:43.270
and will struggle

08:43.270 --> 08:44.600
like a drowning person.

08:47.430 --> 08:48.230
Besides,

08:49.310 --> 08:52.110
the Ever-Burning Wood is in Zhao Yuanzhou's body.

08:53.300 --> 08:55.160
After the five senses are sealed,

08:55.320 --> 08:57.980
the fire will burn his entire body.

08:59.450 --> 09:01.060
It'll be torturous.

09:03.350 --> 09:04.390
Zhao Yuanzhou.

09:05.400 --> 09:07.400
The last needle has been completed.

09:07.420 --> 09:09.070
Spit out your inner core.

09:14.270 --> 09:15.670
Zhao Yuanzhou.

09:17.310 --> 09:18.420
Zhao Yuanzhou!

10:34.390 --> 10:35.590
Zhao Yuanzhou.

10:37.470 --> 10:38.690
Zhao Yuanzhou!

10:58.430 --> 10:59.320
Sir.

10:59.880 --> 11:01.080
What's going on?

11:03.450 --> 11:04.980
Should we just capture him

11:05.360 --> 11:07.160
and take the inner core by force?

12:23.160 --> 12:24.910
Wen Xiao killed the Prime Minister.

12:24.910 --> 12:26.750
Pei Sijing released Zhao Yuanzhou privately.

12:26.750 --> 12:28.070
Arrest them immediately

12:28.070 --> 12:29.730
to wait for their punishment.

12:49.510 --> 12:50.310
Time to eat.

13:00.320 --> 13:01.390
So bland.

13:02.000 --> 13:03.890
I'm a demoness who eats humans.

13:04.240 --> 13:05.900
Fresh human flesh

13:06.380 --> 13:08.600
is much better than fish and meat.

13:09.200 --> 13:10.140
Cut the crap.

13:10.270 --> 13:12.800
The Chongwu Army has seen all kinds of demons.

13:12.870 --> 13:13.710
Look up

13:13.710 --> 13:14.750
at the beast blood talismans.

13:14.750 --> 13:17.680
They're used to suppress you, evil and sneaky demon.

13:42.580 --> 13:43.610
At this time,

13:43.840 --> 13:46.040
you're still in the mood to joke around.

13:48.950 --> 13:50.910
Aren't you worried at all?

13:56.470 --> 13:59.100
It's my first time being a caged animal.

13:59.950 --> 14:01.590
How can I not worry?

14:04.870 --> 14:06.730
I'm talking about Zhao Yuanzhou.

14:14.970 --> 14:16.740
If he goes out of control again,

14:17.470 --> 14:19.320
the world will be over.

14:21.010 --> 14:22.290
Aren't you worried?

14:29.710 --> 14:31.950
I picked up the flagon he left behind.

14:32.400 --> 14:33.850
He drank a lot.

14:34.330 --> 14:37.190
He also has the help Mountain God Ying Zhao's power.

14:37.300 --> 14:40.900
He should be able to suppress the malicious energy temporarily.

14:42.820 --> 14:44.410
Since he chose to run away,

14:45.000 --> 14:47.580
he must still be clear-headed.

14:47.780 --> 14:49.440
He knew he couldn't stay long.

14:52.280 --> 14:53.650
Where would he go?

14:56.650 --> 14:59.180
He'd probably escape to Peach Blossom House.

14:59.520 --> 15:01.690
He set a barrier there.

15:01.990 --> 15:04.050
Outsiders are unable to go in and out.

15:04.980 --> 15:06.770
He once told me

15:07.910 --> 15:09.490
that if one day,

15:10.480 --> 15:12.740
he felt like he was going to lose control,

15:12.890 --> 15:14.780
he would lock himself up.

15:16.480 --> 15:18.280
So even if he went out of control,

15:19.020 --> 15:20.540
he wouldn't hurt anyone.

15:25.830 --> 15:28.220
But this is just a temporary measure.

15:28.680 --> 15:29.560
So,

15:30.210 --> 15:32.360
we should find the Divine Wood as soon as possible

15:32.360 --> 15:33.890
and repair the Baize Token.

15:36.650 --> 15:38.750
Zhuo will find a way.

15:41.550 --> 15:42.020
Yes.

16:34.020 --> 16:36.990
Why are you still struggling?

16:39.990 --> 16:43.430
This is the strongest power in the world.

16:44.770 --> 16:47.200
You can destroy the world

16:47.280 --> 16:49.040
and do anything.

16:50.300 --> 16:52.390
Why do you refuse?

16:56.320 --> 17:00.260
Because I don't want to destroy the world.

17:03.950 --> 17:05.890
No matter what you want,

17:07.750 --> 17:10.160
the invincible power

17:10.160 --> 17:12.290
can do it for you.

17:22.670 --> 17:25.390
I just want the people I cherish

17:27.990 --> 17:29.840
to be safe,

17:31.370 --> 17:32.690
happy,

17:33.350 --> 17:34.120
and content.

17:59.960 --> 18:02.640
How long can you hold on for?

18:04.550 --> 18:07.050
Why don't you just

18:07.900 --> 18:10.790
give yourself to me obediently like before?

18:15.950 --> 18:19.410
Fighting against yourself is like going against the current.

18:19.980 --> 18:22.330
It's futile.

18:22.630 --> 18:24.310
Why endure the pain

18:28.360 --> 18:30.010
of fire burning your heart?

18:35.900 --> 18:38.330
So you don't understand.

18:47.990 --> 18:49.670
What?

18:56.560 --> 18:59.080
♫A lone boat drifts through the world♫

18:59.100 --> 19:01.670
♫The heart feels bitter, then sweet♫

19:02.030 --> 19:07.070
♫Can't distinguish night from day♫

19:08.340 --> 19:10.130
♫At the edge of the dreamscape♫

19:10.300 --> 19:12.790
♫Someone is longing for♫

19:13.120 --> 19:14.030
♫Softly calling for♫

19:14.110 --> 19:18.270
♫A past that can't be brought back♫

19:18.680 --> 19:21.210
♫The world echoes with a single sigh♫

19:21.270 --> 19:23.870
♫Love and hate each fills half the heart♫

19:24.060 --> 19:29.160
♫The years are filled with grudges and grace♫

19:30.340 --> 19:32.390
♫The cry of summer cicadas♫

19:32.480 --> 19:35.040
♫The slumber of winter snow♫

19:35.280 --> 19:40.550
♫No idle wishes and no hopeless longing for eternity♫

19:40.800 --> 19:46.110
♫Who saw the young man in beautiful clothes♫

19:46.330 --> 19:51.650
♫One step at a time, chasing every yesterday♫

19:52.290 --> 19:54.850
♫The sun beams down on the world♫

19:55.000 --> 19:57.520
♫Put everything behind♫

19:57.760 --> 20:03.040
♫You appear in my dream♫

20:11.020 --> 20:15.860
♫The flower in my palm♫

20:16.160 --> 20:21.350
♫Is everchanging♫

20:21.980 --> 20:26.870
♫Sand slips through fingertips♫

20:27.560 --> 20:32.280
♫Struggling again and again♫

20:33.300 --> 20:38.070
♫The sea of suffering has no end♫

20:38.980 --> 20:42.010
♫The spring breeze asks him♫

20:42.160 --> 20:49.440
♫What troubles turned his hair white♫

21:13.050 --> 21:15.570
♫One light, one fire, one crescent moon♫

21:15.860 --> 21:18.410
♫The vow of life and death♫

21:18.760 --> 21:23.760
♫Yet tears leave without a goodbye♫

21:24.270 --> 21:26.840
♫No need to borrow strong wine; it's in my heart♫

21:27.200 --> 21:29.590
♫The dark hair doesn't turn white like snow♫

21:29.690 --> 21:31.120
♫Some other time♫

21:31.200 --> 21:34.870
♫Let's watch the setting sun again♫

21:35.430 --> 21:37.950
♫A lone boat drifts through the world♫

21:38.030 --> 21:40.690
♫The heart feels bitter, then sweet♫

21:41.130 --> 21:45.960
♫Can't distinguish night from day♫

21:46.740 --> 21:49.380
♫The world echoes with a single sigh♫

21:49.530 --> 21:51.930
♫Love and hate each fills half the heart♫

21:52.300 --> 21:53.310
♫Don't forget♫

21:53.650 --> 21:57.400
♫The unforgotten past♫

21:57.450 --> 22:02.610
♫Who saw the young man in beautiful clothes♫

22:03.030 --> 22:08.120
With staggering steps but not asking about tomorrow

22:08.670 --> 22:11.420
If I can live a peaceful

22:09.110 --> 22:11.630
♫The sun beams down on the world♫

22:11.760 --> 22:14.250
♫Put everything behind♫

22:12.500 --> 22:14.420
and carefree life,

22:14.530 --> 22:15.840
♫I see♫

22:15.880 --> 22:19.090
♫You're in front of me♫

22:17.950 --> 22:19.380
No pain

22:19.640 --> 22:24.810
♫Who misses the youth gazing at the bitter sea♫

22:22.100 --> 22:23.620
can bear it

22:25.370 --> 22:30.160
♫He shouted and wanted to be heard by the world♫

22:26.190 --> 22:28.110
It's worth enduring

22:31.370 --> 22:33.890
♫The cruel debts of fate♫

22:34.100 --> 22:36.530
♫Are exchanged for the phrase "I'm willing"♫

22:36.890 --> 22:38.130
♫Wind blows in the distance♫

22:38.250 --> 22:42.000
♫The distant boat approaches the shore♫

22:55.170 --> 22:57.700
This must be where the woodcutter was killed.

22:58.500 --> 22:59.930
The smell of sulfur is so strong.

22:59.930 --> 23:01.190
It's definitely here.

23:03.400 --> 23:04.190
Who is it?

23:09.350 --> 23:10.530
Mr. Zhuo?

23:10.570 --> 23:11.790
Why are you here?

23:13.670 --> 23:15.000
I had to relieve myself.

23:16.380 --> 23:17.290
I understand.

23:20.170 --> 23:21.320
Nonsense.

23:21.480 --> 23:22.760
This smell is not right.

23:22.760 --> 23:24.380
It smells like sulfur.

23:24.470 --> 23:25.750
You are Ao Yin.

23:26.110 --> 23:27.710
Why did you pretend to be the Goddess

23:27.710 --> 23:28.950
and kill the Prime Minister?

23:28.950 --> 23:30.740
And now, you want to pretend to be Mr. Zhuo.

23:30.740 --> 23:32.400
Fortunately, I'm very smart,

23:32.410 --> 23:33.490
quick-sighted,

23:33.680 --> 23:34.920
insightful,

23:34.920 --> 23:36.230
and handsome.

23:37.450 --> 23:38.250
Tell me.

23:38.900 --> 23:40.740
What do you want?

23:46.350 --> 23:47.710
Mountain God Ying Lei,

23:48.270 --> 23:49.310
you're amazing.

23:52.230 --> 23:53.570
No.

23:53.990 --> 23:55.680
Mr. Zhuo would only call me

23:56.230 --> 23:57.670
"Little Mountain God."

24:03.360 --> 24:04.570
Stand there.

24:09.670 --> 24:10.820
Mr. Zhuo.

24:12.010 --> 24:13.820
I was the one who hurt everyone.

24:14.480 --> 24:17.010
Thank you for giving me a chance to follow you.

24:21.520 --> 24:22.520
Are you scared?

24:31.330 --> 24:32.500
Scared?

24:36.300 --> 24:38.000
As long as I can save Wen,

24:38.740 --> 24:40.000
I'm not scared.

24:49.990 --> 24:51.320
Then follow me closely.

25:13.440 --> 25:14.350
Hold it.

25:24.330 --> 25:25.860
I'm afraid you'll get lost.

25:42.070 --> 25:42.750
Who is it?

25:46.220 --> 25:47.180
Ying Lei!

25:47.470 --> 25:48.190
Are you crazy?

25:48.190 --> 25:49.520
Why are you fighting us?

25:50.120 --> 25:51.300
It's not Ying Lei.

25:52.240 --> 25:53.720
It's Ao Yin.

25:57.330 --> 25:58.130
Stop!

25:58.910 --> 25:59.750
Mr. Zhuo!

26:03.230 --> 26:04.710
Brother Zhuo, slow down!

26:04.750 --> 26:05.830
Wait for me.

26:06.040 --> 26:06.520
Hey!

26:06.640 --> 26:07.910
Wait for me!

26:11.840 --> 26:13.030
Watch out, Mr. Zhuo!

26:13.060 --> 26:14.080
She is Ao Yin.

26:14.370 --> 26:15.970
You are Ao Yin.

26:16.430 --> 26:17.730
I have the Cloud Light Sword.

26:17.730 --> 26:19.060
How can I be Ao Yin?

26:19.090 --> 26:20.180
I'm holding my kitchen knife!

26:20.180 --> 26:21.230
I can’t be Ao Yin!

26:21.250 --> 26:23.380
You can get a kitchen knife from any stall,

26:23.380 --> 26:25.780
but the Cloud Light Sword cannot be forged.

26:27.630 --> 26:29.380
That makes sense...

26:29.400 --> 26:31.280
What is the first constellation closest to Mount Kunlun's main door

26:31.280 --> 26:33.550
on the Constellation Formation Map?

26:35.400 --> 26:36.590
I knew it, you're Ao Yin!

26:36.590 --> 26:37.350
Wait.

26:37.370 --> 26:38.280
Wait, wait, wait.

26:38.280 --> 26:39.270
This question is too difficult!

26:39.270 --> 26:41.130
I've never been studious since young.

26:41.130 --> 26:41.730
Hmm.

26:41.760 --> 26:42.760
That makes sense.

26:46.440 --> 26:47.870
What's your dream?

26:48.040 --> 26:48.880
To be a cook!

26:48.980 --> 26:50.060
Who was

26:50.080 --> 26:52.540
the last witness of your beauty in your 200s?

26:52.920 --> 26:55.550
T-T-The mirror in Zhao Yuanzhou's house.

26:55.730 --> 26:56.610
That's right.

26:56.950 --> 26:58.360
He is Ying Lei.

26:58.510 --> 26:59.350
That's right.

27:00.190 --> 27:00.950
Wait, no.

27:00.970 --> 27:02.430
The first thing you shouted

27:02.430 --> 27:03.970
was for Mr. Zhuo to be careful.

27:03.970 --> 27:05.970
Why didn't you tell me to be careful?

27:05.990 --> 27:07.790
Do I look that despicable?

27:07.820 --> 27:08.370
Yep.

27:08.630 --> 27:09.730
It's confirmed.

27:09.760 --> 27:11.080
He is definitely Ying Lei.

27:11.080 --> 27:11.760
Yes.

27:13.960 --> 27:15.630
Why don't you suspect me?

27:15.760 --> 27:17.120
You're Jiu.

27:17.480 --> 27:19.290
You smell of herbs.

27:20.630 --> 27:21.590
Mr. Zhuo,

27:21.630 --> 27:22.760
you can smell it too?

27:22.780 --> 27:23.670
Since I was young,

27:23.670 --> 27:25.480
I've loved the smell of herbs

27:26.380 --> 27:27.720
because it made me feel

27:27.870 --> 27:28.850
calm

27:28.910 --> 27:29.770
and reassured.

27:31.470 --> 27:33.140
I also like the smell of herbs

27:33.390 --> 27:35.900
and garlic,

27:36.410 --> 27:37.950
onion, green pepper,

27:38.030 --> 27:39.110
vegetables, carrots,

27:39.110 --> 27:39.870
turnips,

27:39.870 --> 27:41.530
and...

27:41.630 --> 27:42.550
Coriander smells good too.

27:42.550 --> 27:43.450
What's wrong with him?

27:43.450 --> 27:45.650
Actually, potatoes are not bad either.

27:50.170 --> 27:51.090
Jiu!

28:35.420 --> 28:36.540
You said

28:36.970 --> 28:40.630
you suspect someone instructed the murderer to commit the crime.

28:40.760 --> 28:41.940
Yes.

28:43.430 --> 28:45.940
They framed me at this time,

28:46.390 --> 28:47.670
probably to stop me

28:47.690 --> 28:49.490
from repairing the Baize Token.

28:51.310 --> 28:53.080
This case is full of errors.

28:53.310 --> 28:56.070
The investigation procedure was a mess.

28:56.560 --> 28:58.130
Do you have any idea

28:58.540 --> 28:59.650
who ordered this?

29:02.350 --> 29:03.400
Wen Zongyu.

29:08.140 --> 29:09.280
But

29:09.430 --> 29:12.110
the Prime Minister was obviously killed by a demon.

29:12.110 --> 29:13.980
Wen Zongyu is a mortal.

29:14.040 --> 29:16.370
How could he make a demon obey him?

29:18.990 --> 29:19.930
You're right.

29:38.380 --> 29:39.370
Previously,

29:39.750 --> 29:41.550
in the illusion of Li Lun,

29:42.040 --> 29:43.110
I saw a female demon

29:43.110 --> 29:44.870
who looked exactly like you.

29:46.750 --> 29:48.950
She seemed to be a subordinate of Li Lun.

29:50.030 --> 29:50.910
Li Lun?

29:52.200 --> 29:52.840
Yes.

29:55.220 --> 29:57.090
But Li Lun is dead.

29:58.400 --> 30:00.000
He burned to ashes

30:00.350 --> 30:01.650
in front of you.

30:04.390 --> 30:05.970
But at that time,

30:07.170 --> 30:09.870
we couldn't find Li Lun's inner core.

30:11.090 --> 30:12.810
Is Li Lun really dead?

30:16.370 --> 30:18.500
Why don't we see his inner core?

30:19.330 --> 30:20.750
The Ever-Burning Wood

30:21.650 --> 30:23.370
is the king of fire.

30:24.340 --> 30:26.070
It can burn everything.

30:26.640 --> 30:28.360
I'm afraid even the inner core

30:28.390 --> 30:29.920
was unable to be preserved.

30:36.930 --> 30:38.370
You mean

30:39.640 --> 30:41.060
Li Lun is not dead?

30:50.310 --> 30:52.190
Pei Sijing, someone wants to see you.

30:52.190 --> 30:52.870
Who?

30:53.110 --> 30:54.310
Why do you ask so much?

31:00.630 --> 31:01.900
Sister Pei.

31:01.930 --> 31:02.930
It's okay.

31:03.030 --> 31:04.230
You be careful.

31:24.230 --> 31:25.490
Ao Yin

31:28.620 --> 31:30.830
can transform at will?

31:31.200 --> 31:32.900
That's difficult to deal with.

31:32.900 --> 31:34.060
If she

31:34.080 --> 31:35.420
finds out our secrets

31:35.450 --> 31:36.470
and habits,

31:36.770 --> 31:38.900
won't it be harder to distinguish her?

31:39.040 --> 31:39.900
Yes.

31:40.140 --> 31:41.830
She's extremely fast.

31:41.860 --> 31:43.120
It's hard to catch her.

31:44.440 --> 31:45.730
The forest is spacious

31:45.760 --> 31:47.020
and humid.

31:47.210 --> 31:48.390
The smell of sulfur

31:48.410 --> 31:50.070
has become too faint to trace.

31:51.270 --> 31:53.140
Based on her lifestyle,

31:53.390 --> 31:55.190
where would she typically hide?

31:57.640 --> 31:58.590
Now is the time

31:59.070 --> 32:00.830
for me, the little Mountain God,

32:00.830 --> 32:02.990
to turn the tide.

32:04.690 --> 32:06.330
When Ao Yin ran away,

32:06.590 --> 32:07.890
I sprinkled

32:07.920 --> 32:10.160
my special spice on her.

32:10.700 --> 32:11.680
The smell is unique.

32:11.680 --> 32:12.740
It's easy to track.

32:14.660 --> 32:15.440
But

32:15.470 --> 32:17.670
Mr. Zhuo said she's extremely fast.

32:17.690 --> 32:19.110
Even if we track her down,

32:19.140 --> 32:20.740
it'll be hard to capture her.

32:20.830 --> 32:22.600
Then just continue to sprinkle spices.

32:22.600 --> 32:24.220
Don't you have another type of spice?

32:24.220 --> 32:24.790
Spice?

32:26.000 --> 32:27.000
Huanling Powder?

32:27.910 --> 32:28.550
Yes.

32:28.710 --> 32:29.230
I have plenty

32:29.230 --> 32:30.460
of Huanling Powder.

32:30.570 --> 32:32.620
But for Ao Yin,

32:33.010 --> 32:34.340
it doesn't seem enough.

32:35.450 --> 32:36.380
What do you need?

32:39.620 --> 32:40.410
That thing?

32:41.560 --> 32:42.540
I got it.

32:42.750 --> 32:45.080
We're missing Kusnezoff Monkshood Root.

32:45.380 --> 32:46.570
Kusnezoff Monkshood Root?

32:46.570 --> 32:48.030
Kusnezoff Monkshood Root

32:48.050 --> 32:49.250
can paralyze people.

32:49.260 --> 32:50.690
It also works on demons.

32:50.710 --> 32:52.770
It can greatly weaken Ao Yin’s speed.

32:55.790 --> 32:56.590
Mr. Zhuo,

32:56.830 --> 32:58.180
aren't I amazing?

32:59.620 --> 33:00.850
You're amazing.

33:00.990 --> 33:03.250
You're indeed the best doctor in Tiandu.

33:07.290 --> 33:09.100
One-Word Spell.

33:09.560 --> 33:11.040
Endure.

33:20.620 --> 33:23.350
Zhen Mei was seriously injured by Zhao Yuanzhou.

33:23.350 --> 33:25.410
It's unknown whether he'll survive.

33:26.490 --> 33:28.770
Once his position becomes vacant,

33:30.820 --> 33:33.920
I hope you, Ms. Pei, can replace him.

33:35.450 --> 33:38.250
Replace him and continue to be your shield?

33:39.410 --> 33:40.900
Why do you think

33:40.920 --> 33:42.750
everyone in the world

33:43.210 --> 33:45.040
is willing to die for you?

33:47.680 --> 33:49.740
Chaos in the Wilderness is imminent.

33:50.960 --> 33:52.950
Demons will swarm here

33:53.030 --> 33:55.000
and take over the mortal world.

33:55.710 --> 33:58.490
Your brother was killed by a demon.

33:58.910 --> 34:01.610
I can relate to this painful experience.

34:02.090 --> 34:04.260
Logically, both of us should

34:04.510 --> 34:07.020
hate demons viciously.

34:08.560 --> 34:10.780
You said you can relate to me

34:10.810 --> 34:12.570
and hate demons to the bone.

34:14.370 --> 34:15.480
Could it be

34:16.389 --> 34:18.120
that an important person to you

34:18.630 --> 34:20.370
was also killed by a demon?

34:23.630 --> 34:25.130
You don't need to ask.

34:26.870 --> 34:29.040
I heard about your rumors before.

34:29.420 --> 34:31.679
You joined Chongwu Camp ten years ago

34:32.340 --> 34:34.409
and were just an ordinary soldier.

34:36.150 --> 34:37.830
But in a short decade,

34:38.500 --> 34:40.130
you rose through the ranks

34:40.389 --> 34:42.219
and became the advisor.

34:42.550 --> 34:44.230
Everyone was puzzled.

34:46.540 --> 34:48.449
That's due to my abilities.

34:48.590 --> 34:50.239
I contributed too much.

34:50.750 --> 34:52.790
I just kept a low profile

34:52.929 --> 34:55.190
and didn't want to show off to the others.

34:55.710 --> 34:58.510
That's because you've done too many dirty things

34:58.530 --> 35:00.260
and you can't see the light.

35:01.030 --> 35:02.630
Zhen Mei is just your puppet.

35:02.630 --> 35:03.590
Zhen Mei

35:04.420 --> 35:05.770
is an orphan.

35:05.790 --> 35:08.240
I adopted him.

35:08.470 --> 35:10.480
Of course he's obedient to me.

35:12.430 --> 35:14.430
But you are so heartless.

35:15.830 --> 35:17.370
In order to save you,

35:17.500 --> 35:18.710
Zhen Mei was heavily injured

35:18.710 --> 35:20.290
and it's uncertain if he'll survive.

35:20.290 --> 35:21.520
And now,

35:21.630 --> 35:23.580
you are using his official position

35:23.580 --> 35:25.170
to negotiate with me.

35:26.430 --> 35:28.030
It seems that

35:30.320 --> 35:31.600
you don't agree.

35:48.430 --> 35:49.730
If you agree,

35:49.990 --> 35:51.270
you can live

35:51.270 --> 35:53.400
and be the commander of Chongwu Camp.

35:54.340 --> 35:55.720
If you refuse,

35:56.380 --> 35:58.150
you have to die

35:58.470 --> 36:00.590
and become food for demons.

36:01.060 --> 36:02.070
It's your choice.

36:25.070 --> 36:25.950
Are you okay?

36:28.670 --> 36:29.710
I’m fine.

36:34.900 --> 36:36.480
Is it the advisor?

36:37.270 --> 36:38.070
Yes.

36:39.030 --> 36:40.390
He is scheming

36:40.420 --> 36:41.740
and vicious.

36:41.830 --> 36:42.790
I'm worried that...

36:42.790 --> 36:44.390
You have no confidence in me?

36:47.010 --> 36:49.470
It's not that I don't have confidence in you.

36:49.930 --> 36:51.990
I just can't make up my mind.

36:52.950 --> 36:54.890
The food will be delivered soon.

36:55.470 --> 36:56.970
I wondered if I should wait for you

36:56.970 --> 36:58.400
to eat it or not?

37:01.190 --> 37:02.280
What?

37:02.950 --> 37:05.030
You need someone for company

37:05.440 --> 37:07.300
to eat a bun and a bowl of rice soup?

37:08.920 --> 37:10.190
Just going with the flow

37:10.190 --> 37:11.720
and finding joy in the pain.

37:14.190 --> 37:15.850
With a best friend's company,

37:16.190 --> 37:17.670
even bland soup is a feast.

37:19.010 --> 37:20.800
Being alone,

37:21.300 --> 37:22.560
even golden goblets

37:22.660 --> 37:23.950
are superficial.

37:31.740 --> 37:33.040
So pretentious.

37:33.070 --> 37:35.070
Did you learn it from Zhao Yuanzhou?

37:35.960 --> 37:37.170
Thank you, Sister.

37:57.430 --> 38:00.310
You even changed your clothes.

38:00.530 --> 38:01.790
What do you know?

38:08.490 --> 38:09.490
The smell of spices

38:09.490 --> 38:10.830
ends here.

38:11.350 --> 38:12.510
She must be inside.

38:18.790 --> 38:19.650
How old are you?

38:19.660 --> 38:20.740
Shameless!

38:32.510 --> 38:33.310
Ying Lei,

38:34.100 --> 38:35.440
are you sure?

38:36.030 --> 38:37.740
Do you know what this place is?

38:37.760 --> 38:39.820
It looks fun.

38:41.990 --> 38:44.710
It's a place you kids shouldn't come.

38:46.150 --> 38:47.490
Goodness.

38:48.530 --> 38:50.790
I'm 237 years and 3 months old.

38:50.790 --> 38:51.830
Mr. Zhuo,

38:51.830 --> 38:53.760
may I ask what age you are this year?

38:54.280 --> 38:55.200
Twenty-four.

38:56.600 --> 38:57.660
Nominal age.

39:00.870 --> 39:02.530
The smell of rouge here is heavy.

39:02.530 --> 39:04.660
In order to cover up her scent,

39:04.750 --> 39:07.280
Ao Yin might choose to hide here.

39:07.320 --> 39:08.950
Then why didn’t she choose

39:08.950 --> 39:10.890
the garbage pile of the underground sewer?

39:10.890 --> 39:12.940
It could've been a better cover.

39:13.820 --> 39:14.700
Right.

39:14.930 --> 39:17.000
Ao Yin is a girl after all.

39:17.990 --> 39:18.550
My grandpa said…

39:18.550 --> 39:19.150
All right.

39:19.790 --> 39:20.980
If you want to continue chatting,

39:20.980 --> 39:22.140
stay here.

39:22.670 --> 39:23.430
If you want to investigate,

39:23.430 --> 39:24.980
shut up and come in with me.

39:25.440 --> 39:26.490
Mr. Zhuo.

39:28.190 --> 39:30.120
I have one more thing to remind you.

39:30.230 --> 39:30.790
Ao Yin

39:31.050 --> 39:33.220
is not only fast and agile.

39:33.310 --> 39:34.000
Her voice

39:34.350 --> 39:36.170
can also be hypnotic.

39:36.260 --> 39:37.020
Remember.

39:37.040 --> 39:39.030
Don't be brainwashed

39:39.060 --> 39:40.470
by her sweet words.

39:41.600 --> 39:42.600
Hey!

39:44.020 --> 39:46.080
Don't you listen to Mr. Zhuo the most?

39:46.660 --> 39:47.400
He said

39:47.820 --> 39:50.130
this is not a place for kids.

39:50.350 --> 39:51.910
What if Ao Yin is really in there?

39:51.910 --> 39:53.780
It might be dangerous there.

39:54.180 --> 39:55.260
Wait here.

39:56.190 --> 39:56.840
Okay.

40:03.320 --> 40:04.580
You're this obedient?

40:17.960 --> 40:25.570
[Tianxiang Pavilion]

40:26.380 --> 40:28.060
Sir, come and play.

40:28.150 --> 40:31.280
Isn't this the dream man of thousands of girls of Tiandu?

40:31.290 --> 40:32.870
It's really Mr. Zhuo Yichen.

40:32.870 --> 40:34.380
What brings him here?

40:34.420 --> 40:35.220
I...

40:35.540 --> 40:36.670
Am I drunk?

40:40.870 --> 40:42.200
Zhuo Yichen.

40:42.440 --> 40:44.100
Girls, come here.

40:44.190 --> 40:46.830
Zhuo Yichen came to Tianxiang Pavilion!

40:47.260 --> 40:48.670
Don't... Don't shout.

40:48.670 --> 40:49.710
I'm not here for fun.

40:49.710 --> 40:51.110
I'm looking for someone.

40:51.150 --> 40:52.140
I understand.

40:52.230 --> 40:53.980
Keep a low profile.

40:54.230 --> 40:56.950
Girls, our chance to get rich is right before our eyes!

40:56.950 --> 40:57.840
Come here.

40:57.840 --> 40:58.790
Come here!

40:58.910 --> 41:01.150
Mr. Zhuo is looking for someone.

41:02.550 --> 41:05.340
You're good at everything.

41:05.360 --> 41:08.170
You're as handsome as the legends say,

41:08.200 --> 41:10.060
with your fair skin and red lips.

41:12.230 --> 41:13.070
Mr. Zhuo.

41:13.090 --> 41:14.200
Brother!

41:15.590 --> 41:16.740
Jiu.

41:20.070 --> 41:20.910
Jiu.

41:20.930 --> 41:22.310
Thank goodness you're here.

41:22.310 --> 41:22.910
No biggie.

41:22.930 --> 41:23.970
Why are you here?

41:25.110 --> 41:25.890
If it weren't for me,

41:25.890 --> 41:27.440
I'm telling you…

41:29.480 --> 41:30.610
If it weren't for me,

41:30.620 --> 41:31.610
you...

41:32.830 --> 41:33.630
What's wrong?

41:35.810 --> 41:37.280
It smells like my spices.

41:39.670 --> 41:41.580
Is that the dancer?

41:48.940 --> 41:50.100
I'm not sure.

41:51.320 --> 41:52.760
The smell is gone.

41:54.500 --> 41:55.550
Keep looking.

42:15.450 --> 42:16.250
It's her.

42:21.270 --> 42:22.450
Let's split up.

42:22.480 --> 42:23.570
Surround her.

42:23.830 --> 42:24.500
Okay.

42:24.920 --> 42:25.220
Let's go.

42:25.220 --> 42:25.760
Let's go.

42:33.870 --> 42:35.050
Miss.

42:40.120 --> 42:41.290
Miss, please wait.

42:43.840 --> 42:44.640
Miss!

42:50.930 --> 42:51.730
Miss.

42:52.020 --> 42:53.220
I'm sorry.

43:14.760 --> 43:15.390
She's getting away!

43:15.390 --> 43:16.310
Brat,

43:16.340 --> 43:18.210
what did you sprinkle on me?

43:18.960 --> 43:20.770
Why am I running so slow?

43:20.790 --> 43:22.010
Stop!

43:22.390 --> 43:23.200
Don't move!

43:23.230 --> 43:23.860
Stop!

43:23.890 --> 43:25.080
Stop!

43:25.330 --> 43:26.050
Come back!

43:26.940 --> 43:27.930
Oh my.

43:27.950 --> 43:28.880
Sister Pei.

43:28.990 --> 43:29.650
Why is it you?

43:29.650 --> 43:31.000
How dare you ask me?

43:31.030 --> 43:33.400
We ended up like this because you were

43:33.510 --> 43:34.710
a spy from Chongwu Camp.

43:34.710 --> 43:35.270
I'm sorry.

43:35.270 --> 43:35.930
Sister Pei,

43:35.930 --> 43:36.840
I was wrong.

43:36.950 --> 43:38.150
Sister Pei, you're injured.

43:38.150 --> 43:39.370
Liar!

43:39.990 --> 43:41.170
Traitor!

43:43.310 --> 43:43.870
You...

43:43.950 --> 43:45.470
You are not Pei Sijing!

43:45.550 --> 43:46.810
You are Ao Yin!

43:46.870 --> 43:47.390
You...

43:47.390 --> 43:48.170
Stop!

43:51.550 --> 43:52.820
How dare a minor demon

43:52.860 --> 43:55.270
get in my way?

43:57.060 --> 43:58.510
I'll leave immediately.

43:58.630 --> 44:00.070
I'm going back to the Wilderness.

44:00.070 --> 44:01.630
I'll take him away too.

44:13.090 --> 44:13.730
Wen Xiao?

44:13.760 --> 44:14.520
Zhuo,

44:14.540 --> 44:15.900
it's me.

44:25.810 --> 44:26.530
No.

44:28.010 --> 44:28.610
Zhuo,

44:28.640 --> 44:29.630
look at me.

44:30.030 --> 44:30.910
Look at me.

44:31.800 --> 44:32.560
Shameless!

44:40.070 --> 44:41.380
Zhuo.

44:43.480 --> 44:45.690
Why are you pointing a sword at me?

44:49.960 --> 44:51.000
Zhuo,

44:52.110 --> 44:53.720
I'm Wen Xiao.

44:54.830 --> 44:56.130
Wen Xiao.

44:56.770 --> 44:58.480
Don't you love me?

45:05.160 --> 45:06.290
Zhuo?

45:08.750 --> 45:09.750
Zhuo!

45:15.610 --> 45:17.120
Zhuo.
